<LegalPage title="Cookie Policy | TrueLine Finishes" description="Which cookies the TrueLine Finishes website uses: none of its own, no analytics and no advertising. The embedded Google map is explained here." h1="Cookie Policy" page="cookie-policy" lead="What this website stores on your device, and what the content embedded from other websites may store.">
  <p>Last updated: 6 November 2026.</p>
  <h2>Cookies set by this website</h2>
  <p>None. The TrueLine Finishes website does not set its own cookies. It uses no analytics, tracking or advertising cookies, so there is nothing to accept or turn off.</p>
  <h2>The Google map on the home and Contact pages</h2>
  <p>The home page and the Contact page show a Google Maps embed of the TrueLine Finishes Business Profile. Google may set cookies when the map loads, under Google's own privacy policy.</p>
  <h2>The Google reviews</h2>
  <p>The Google reviews shown on this website, the review strips and the small reviews badge, are loaded from Trustindex, a review display service, which shows the reviews from the TrueLine Finishes Google Business Profile. When we checked, it set no cookies on your device. Clicking through to a review opens Trustindex's or Google's own website, under their own privacy policies.</p>
  <h2>The quote form</h2>
  <p>The quote form is provided by an enquiry form service and loads from that service's website. It is used only to send your enquiry to us and is not used for advertising.</p>
  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser's settings. Blocking cookies from Google may stop the map from working, but the rest of the site, including the quote form and phone number, will work as normal.</p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact Brandon on 07949 484274 or at <a href="mailto:Brandon@truelinefinishes.com">Brandon@truelinefinishes.com</a>. Our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains how we use the details you send us.</p>
</LegalPage>
